    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a01bdd4b573386b4a6315c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这一天举办了大规模的模拟赛，\n目的是替学园里的赛马娘提升技术与干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e61f55c16c843851d5fcf2fff9d162be55c315f789083554a137435c40b38fc7",
